-- ============================================================
-- Clan refactor (A): Village Clan Recruiter fix  (script 75024)
-- ------------------------------------------------------------
-- The recruiter's Type==0 branch only handled "empty clan -> make
-- joiner LEADER" or "has members -> REFUSE (msg 2126)". There was no
-- path to add a normal MEMBER to a player-led clan, which is why the
-- recruiter "stopped accepting" players after a takeover, and why v1
-- of auto_heal had to force clan.Type to the NPC AttribID.
--
-- This edit replaces the refusal with a gated MEMBER-join (same
-- rating>=100 + not-aggroed gates the NPC-led branch already uses):
--   Type==0 + has members  -> join as RANK_MEMBER  (NEW)
--   Type==0 + no members    -> become RANK_LEADER   (unchanged)
--   Type!=0 (NPC-led)        -> join as RANK_MEMBER  (unchanged)
--
-- With this in place the recruiter works at Type==0, so auto_heal no
-- longer needs to force Type and the Clan Advisor (which requires
-- Type==0) works for player leaders.
--
-- Verified: recompiled with luac_fwo and re-decompiled clean.
-- ============================================================
USE fwworlddevdb;
UPDATE script SET , Size=5950 WHERE ScriptID=75024;
